PlayPilot calls these tools as separate programs. No code from them is included.

- agent-device (MIT), https://github.com/callstack/agent-device
- simslim (MIT), https://github.com/MobAI-App/simslim

The option loop (game-level options, a decider, executors and per-game memory) follows the design of
Aura Autopilot (Apache-2.0), https://github.com/ramenvr/autopilot. It is an independent TypeScript
implementation; no code was copied.
